{"id":71293,"date":"2026-10-29T19:13:11","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:13:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71293"},"modified":"2026-11-01T08:39:48","modified_gmt":"2026-11-01T07:39:48","slug":"sao-silvestre-sernancelhe","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-sernancelhe\/","title":{"rendered":"III Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2013 B.V. Sernancelhe 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">III Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2013 B.V. Sernancelhe 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>III Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre \u2013 B.V. Sernancelhe 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida e chegada agendadas para as <strong>19:00<\/strong> junto ao <strong>Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Sernancelhe<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Esta prova noturna de S\u00e3o Silvestre junta atletas e fam\u00edlias em ambiente natal\u00edcio num evento de cariz solid\u00e1rio sob o lema \u00abCorre por uma causa\u00bb.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa contempla uma <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> cronometrada por chip e uma <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de conv\u00edvio aberta a todas as idades, com tempo m\u00e1ximo de 2 horas e posto de abastecimento a partir do km 5. Ambos os percursos atravessam as hist\u00f3ricas ruas da vila de <strong>Sernancelhe<\/strong> \u2014 c\u00e9lebre como a Terra da Castanha \u2014, passando pelo seu centro hist\u00f3rico gran\u00edtico e junto \u00e0 casa onde a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o assinala o nascimento do Marqu\u00eas de Pombal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Sec\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva e Recreativa da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Sernancelhe<\/strong>, revertendo as receitas das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para a aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de equipamento operacional destinado ao socorro da popula\u00e7\u00e3o local, com medalha de finisher atribu\u00edda a todos os inscritos. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 19:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios, Sernancelhe, Viseu<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida) e 5 km (Cami